# Spark IDE - proven open/save bind forms (-> opened / -> saved).
# After open-nopath 5b55c44. Binds already used in ide_hello -
# this slice documents+tests both with print of bound JSON.
# Proof: print opened / print saved show ide.open / ide.save ok JSON.
# Run: ./spark --dry-run examples/ide_bind_forms.spark
# No Electron. No new asm - documents proven forms only.

ide open "examples/hello.spark" -> opened

print opened

ide save "out/ide/ide_bind_forms_rt.spark" -> saved

print saved
